            <title>[LU-21214] lov_foreign_hsm_to_le() swabs destination field instead of source,   corrupting foreign HSM layout EA</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21214</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;  lov_foreign_hsm_to_le() in include/uapi/linux/lustre/lustre_idl.h is&lt;br/&gt;
  supposed to byte-swap the caller-supplied `src` HSM base fields into&lt;br/&gt;
  the on-disk (little-endian) `dst` buffer embedded in the&lt;br/&gt;
  lov_foreign_md. Instead it reads and swabs dst's own (uninitialized)&lt;br/&gt;
  field back into itself, never touching src:&lt;br/&gt;
  static inline void lov_foreign_hsm_to_le(struct lov_foreign_md *lfm,&lt;br/&gt;
                                         struct lov_hsm_base *src)&lt;/p&gt;
  {
        struct lov_hsm_base *dst = (struct lov_hsm_base *)lfm-&amp;gt;lfm_value;
        dst-&amp;gt;lhb_archive_id = __cpu_to_le64(dst-&amp;gt;lhb_archive_id);
        dst-&amp;gt;lhb_archive_ver = __cpu_to_le64(dst-&amp;gt;lhb_archive_ver);
        memcpy(dst-&amp;gt;lhb_uuid, src-&amp;gt;lhb_uuid, sizeof(dst-&amp;gt;lhb_uuid));
  }
&lt;p&gt;  Compare with the inverse helper, lov_foreign_hsm_to_cpu(), which&lt;br/&gt;
  correctly reads from src and writes to dst:&lt;br/&gt;
        dst-&amp;gt;lhb_archive_id = __le64_to_cpu(src-&amp;gt;lhb_archive_id);&lt;br/&gt;
        dst-&amp;gt;lhb_archive_ver = __le64_to_cpu(src-&amp;gt;lhb_archive_ver);&lt;br/&gt;
  Effect: any code path that serializes an HSM-typed foreign layout&lt;br/&gt;
  component (e.g. lod_gen_component_ea_foreign() in&lt;br/&gt;
  lustre/lod/lod_lov.c)&lt;br/&gt;
  never actually writes the caller's lhb_archive_id/lhb_archive_ver&lt;br/&gt;
  into&lt;br/&gt;
  the on-disk lov_foreign_md - dst's pre-existing/uninitialized memory&lt;br/&gt;
  is swabbed in place instead, and the real values from src are&lt;br/&gt;
  silently dropped. Only lhb_uuid is copied correctly.&lt;br/&gt;
  Fix: swab from src into dst, matching lov_foreign_hsm_to_cpu()'s&lt;br/&gt;
  pattern:&lt;br/&gt;
        dst-&amp;gt;lhb_archive_id = __cpu_to_le64(src-&amp;gt;lhb_archive_id);&lt;br/&gt;
        dst-&amp;gt;lhb_archive_ver = __cpu_to_le64(src-&amp;gt;lhb_archive_ver);&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;  Found while adding kunit coverage for lod_gen_component_ea_foreign()&lt;br/&gt;
  under &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-21180" title="kunit test framework for faster and more comprehensive tests" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-21180"&gt;LU-21180&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
